@startuml
title Model Loading Flow

participant "Client" as Client
participant "Handler" as Handler
participant "Download" as Download
participant "Plugin" as Plugin

Client -> Handler : loadModel({ modelSrc, modelType })
Handler -> Download : resolve and fetch source

note right of Download
  Source is a model constant, HTTP URL,
  registry entry, Hyperdrive path, or local file.
end note

Download --> Handler : model path
Handler -> Plugin : createModel(...)
Plugin -> Plugin : load native addon
Handler -> Handler : register model
Handler --> Client : modelId

@enduml
